      "comment": "KEAYANG HUSTLER (8) is a three-year-old colt from the M A Lee, P Lee yard on debut. Will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane to play a big role. Looks to have some talent based on a recent trial win. Well-placed to score at his first appearance. DISPERSION (3) made a solid impact on debut last start, finishing third and beaten 2.5 metres over 2240m at Melton. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. This should be an easier assignment so he is sure to prove tough to beat again. IDEAL HIGH (2) is a two-year-old colt by Ride High from Ideal Glory on debut. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Capable of taking this out. VINCENT ORILEY (6) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 1785m at Stawell last time out.",
